        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "BS0 (pin 10) → GND; BS1 (pin 11) → VCC; BS2 (pin 12) → GND"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The SSD1306 may not operate in the I2C mode used by the connected D0 and D1/D2 signals, so the MCU may be unable to communicate with or control the display.",
      "confidence": 0.87
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The OLED interface-select straps appear reversed from the specified I2C configuration. The connected data signals are arranged for I2C, but the BS pins select a different mode."
}

